Error [E0510]: `core.crypto.expert.aes256_gcm_seal` requires an audited `#Unsafe` region
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_bypass.jet:10:17
    |
 10 |     _ #= expert.aes256_gcm_seal(key, msg)
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: raw crypto primitives may only run inside an explicit expert-tier gate (I1)
 Fix: wrap the call in `#Unsafe("crypto expert: …") { … }` or use `crypto.seal`/`open` instead
